<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Milykdad</Major>
    <Description>In Basketball Legends, master the court with our advanced Dribble Combo and Perfect Shot Combo combined! This dynamic feature lets you seamlessly execute a series of dribbling moves followed by an impeccable shot, all with precise timing and control. The Dribble Combo ensures you can maneuver past defenders with ease, setting up the perfect opportunity for the Perfect Shot Combo, which guarantees a high-accuracy shot to score points effortlessly. Elevate your gameplay and dominate every match with this powerful combo!</Description>
